msgid "Simplified logging"
msgstr "简化日志记录"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quarkus simplifies logging by automatically adding logger fields to classes that use `io.quarkus.logging.Log`.\n"
"This eliminates the need for repetitive boilerplate code and enhances logging setup convenience."
msgstr "Quarkus 通过向使用 `io.quarkus.logging.Log` 的类自动添加日志记录器字段来简化日志记录。这样就不需要重复的模板代码，并提高了日志设置的便利性。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The `io.quarkus.logging.Log` class contains the same methods as JBoss Logging, except that they are `static`."
msgstr "`io.quarkus.logging.Log` 类包含与 JBoss Logging 相同的方法，只不过这些方法是 `static` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that the class does not declare a logger field.\n"
"This is because during application build, a `private static final org.jboss.logging.Logger` field is created automatically in each class that uses the `Log` API.\n"
"The fully qualified name of the class that calls the `Log` methods is used as a logger name.\n"
"In this example, the logger name would be `com.example.MyService`."
msgstr "请注意，该类没有声明日志记录器字段。这是因为在应用程序构建过程中，每个使用 `Log` API 的类都会自动创建一个 `private static final org.jboss.logging.Logger` 字段。调用 `Log` 方法的类的全限定名称被用作日志记录器名称。在本例中，日志记录器名称为 `com.example.MyService` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Finally, all calls to `Log` methods are rewritten to regular JBoss Logging calls on the logger field during the application build."
msgstr "最后，在应用程序构建过程中，所有对 `Log` 方法的调用都会在日志记录器字段上重写为常规的 JBoss Logging 调用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use the `Log` API only in application classes, not in external dependencies.\n"
"`Log` method calls not processed by Quarkus at build time will result in an exception."
msgstr "请仅在应用程序类中使用 `日志` API，不要在外部依赖项中使用。在构建时未由 Quarkus 处理的 `日志` 方法调用将引发异常。"

msgid "Using <code>io.quarkus.logging.Log</code> in extensions:"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "While the `Log` API simplifies logging in application classes, it is not recommended for use in extension modules or external dependencies."
msgstr "虽然 `Log` API 简化了在应用程序类中进行日志记录的操作，但不建议在扩展模块或外部依赖项中使用它。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The following considerations apply:"
msgstr "需考虑以下几点："

#, fuzzy
msgid "`io.quarkus.logging.Log` depends on Quarkus bytecode transformations that occur at build time."
msgstr "`io.quarkus.logging.Log` 依赖于构建时执行的 Quarkus 字节码转换。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In extension modules, `Log` works only if the module includes a Jandex index.\n"
"However, this behavior is unsupported and can lead to unreliable logging."
msgstr "在扩展模块中， `Log` 仅在该模块包含 Jandex 索引时才有效。不过，这种行为不受支持，可能会导致日志记录不可靠。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For extension development, use `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(String)` instead of `io.quarkus.logging.Log`."
msgstr "在开发扩展时，请使用 `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(String)` ，而不是 `io.quarkus.logging.Log` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Injecting a configured logger"
msgstr "注入一个已配置的日志记录器"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The injection of a configured `org.jboss.logging.Logger` logger instance with the `@Inject` annotation is another alternative to adding an application logger, but is applicable only to CDI beans."
msgstr "使用 `@Inject` 注解注入已配置的 `org.jboss.logging.Logger` 日志记录器实例是添加应用程序日志记录器的另一种替代方法，但只适用于 CDI Bean。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can use `@Inject Logger log`, where the logger gets named after the class you inject it to, or `@LoggerName(\"...\") Logger log`, where the logger receives the specified name."
msgstr "您可以使用 `@Inject Logger log` 或 `@LoggerName(\"…​\") Logger log` ，在前者中，日志记录器以您注入的类命名，在后者中，日志记录器接收指定的名称。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "`@Inject` is not required if you already annotated your `Logger` with `@LoggerName(\"...\")`."
msgstr "如果您已经使用 `@LoggerName(\"…​\")` 注解了 `Logger` ，则无需使用 `@Inject` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Once injected, you can use the `log` object to invoke logging methods."
msgstr "注入后，您可以使用 `日志` 对象来调用日志记录方法。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The fully qualified class name (FQCN) of the declaring class is used as a logger name, for example, `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(SimpleBean.class)` will be used."
msgstr "声明类的完全限定类名 (FQCN) 将用作日志记录器名称，例如 `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(SimpleBean.class)` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "In this case, the name _foo_ is used as a logger name, for example, `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(\"foo\")` will be used."
msgstr "在这种情况下，将使用 _foo_ 作为日志记录器名称，例如 `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(\"foo\")` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The logger instances are cached internally.\n"
"Therefore, when a logger is injected, for example, into a `@RequestScoped` bean, it is shared for all bean instances to avoid possible performance penalties associated with logger instantiation."
